\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  I love to hear angels singing\cf0 
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  Angels of God from above,
\par  When the baby Saviour was born
\par  A suckling at Bethlehem.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  Do not fear, do not fear
\par  I bring you news of joy
\par  That will be for all nations
\par  Christ is born today.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. He is Jesus Christ our Master
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  Born in the David's city.
\par  Yes it is a happy good news
\par  For the whole entire lost world
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par All black men and white men
\par  old and young and children
\par  have been saved in Him alone
\par  and they all free indeed.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Suddenly the heavenly host
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  thronged and joined the archangel
\par  and sang with melodious voices
\par  praising God the Lord saying
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Glory be to the Lord
\par  Glory be to the Lord
\par  peace be onto all the nations
\par \pard    and good will towards all men.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

